        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "9a3f8263-81a4-57b9-bff8-0b6a683b889b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Adam Franklin, Jimmy Hartridge, Brandon Boyd, Mike Einziger, Jose Pasillas, Alex \"Dirk Lance\" Katunich, Gavin \"DJ Lyfe\" Koppell, Ben Kenney, DJ Kilmore\n- Bands: Swervedriver, Incubus\n- Products: Son of Mustang Ford, Megalomaniac, A Crow Left of the Murder...\n- Places: Oxford, Calabasas High School\n\nFacts:\n- Swervedriver is an English alternative rock band that was formed in Oxford in 1989 around core members Adam Franklin and Jimmy Hartridge.\n- Incubus was formed in 1991 by Brandon Boyd, Mike Einziger, and Jose Pasillas while they were enrolled at Calabasas High School.\n- Incubus later expanded to include bassist Alex \"Dirk Lance\" Katunich and Gavin \"DJ Lyfe\" Koppell, who were eventually replaced by Ben Kenney and DJ Kilmore respectively.\n- Son of Mustang Ford is the debut EP by the English alternative rock band Swervedriver.\n- \"Megalomaniac\" is a song by the American rock band Incubus from the 2004 album A Crow Left of the Murder....\n- \"Megalomaniac\" was released as a single in December 2003 and reached number one on Billboard's Modern Rock Tracks chart for six weeks.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "36c80617-e6ed-5a31-adb7-ad7e6a7e882b",
        "text": "Page: Swervedriver. Sentence: Swervedriver are an English alternative rock band formed in Oxford in 1989 around core members Adam Franklin and Jimmy Hartridge.\nPage: Incubus (band). Sentence: The band was formed in 1991 by vocalist Brandon Boyd, lead guitarist Mike Einziger, and drummer Jose Pasillas while enrolled in Calabasas High School and later expanded to include bassist Alex \"Dirk Lance\" Katunich, and Gavin \"DJ Lyfe\" Koppell; both of whom were eventually replaced by bassist Ben Kenney and DJ Kilmore respectively.\nPage: Son of Mustang Ford. Sentence: Son of Mustang Ford is the debut EP by English alternative rock band, Swervedriver.\nPage: Megalomaniac (Incubus song). Sentence: \"Megalomaniac\" is a song by the American rock band Incubus, from their 2004 album \"A Crow Left of the Murder...\" It was released as a single in December 2003, and eventually reached the top of \"Billboard\"' s Modern Rock Tracks, where it stayed for a six-week period.",
        "type": "DocumentChunk"
